WEBVTT

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.380
I can't believe my little Non's débuted in PriPara as well.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.250
I'm moved deep in my in-soul-ata caprese.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:23.210
Now all three of the Manaka girls are PriPara idols.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.460
Yep!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.030
Really, though...

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:31.450
Both of you started going to PriPara without a word to your dear mother.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.640
You're both well aware I went to PriPara as a girl, too.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.550
Now, Non. We have a cake your dad whipped up for you.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:44.890
It looks great!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.360
Onee-chan seems more excited than me.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:52.320
Non, congratulations on your PriPara déb-ruschetta!
Non, congratulations on your PriPara début!

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.860
Dad, you're rewinding it <i>again</i>?

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.490
I can't get enough of my daughter's performance!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.630
All three of you are so cute...

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:02.840
Now we have to rewatch Lala's début concert next!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.250
Mama...

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.260
Capisce!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.460
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.210
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.470
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:18.010
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.010
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.560
I wound up losing to you, though, Onee-chan.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.570
Don't worry about that, Non.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.440
You only just débuted, after all.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:09.040
Exactly. And your mother doesn't know of many other girls being three idols at once.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:13.730
I have my hands full being just the one.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:19.100
While we're on the subject, I've been
thinking I'll try a different approach.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.960
I'll give being Triangle a rest for now.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.260
Really? That's such a shame.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.230
But that doesn't mean I've given up.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:31.730
I'll keep getting stronger and show you true defeat!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.160
She's declaring war?

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.650
Okay... then.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.650
Capisce! I'll accept your challenge!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.860
I won't go down easy!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:43.010
That's the spirit! There's no challenge beating you otherwise!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:46.030
I'm better than you at everything, Onee-chan!

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.290
Study, sports, art and music – all of it!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.520
My <i>modus vivendi</i>, too!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.710
If I become a better idol, too, that's everything!

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.110
I'd better make sure I don't lose when it comes to idoling.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.800
Make sure you give it your all, Lala.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.040
It makes a father's heart swell-asagne,

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.390
witnessing such a spirited sibling rivalry!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.350
No time like the pres-ciutto – let's cut the cake!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.110
How should we cut it?

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.780
Into quarters, one for each?

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.180
Mama!

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.610
Did just say "Mama"?

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.140
Of–Of course not!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.130
It was me, Mama!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.740
Make sure you cut me a big piece!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.280
Mama... Mama...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.060
Jululu, you can't leave the Rosette Pact...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.340
Mama!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.480
Shh!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.980
Tortilla!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.870
Man, that was close.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.020
It's looking tight this month too...

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.500
Escargot...

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.420
Here comes Ms Dolphin!

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:47.440
Where's the baby? There she is!

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:49.120
Wada way? Wah!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.890
Where's the baby? There she is!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.970
Wada way? Wah!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.600
I put both hands on my head, and who am I? A bear!

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.020
Fuzzy-wuzzy bear!

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.490
Fuwwy-wuwwy!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.030
I put them in front of my mouth, and who am I? An octopus!

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:06.990
Owwy-woo!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:13.560
Now Mama's gonna race you!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.330
Here we go...

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.970
And we're off!

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.760
You're so <i>fast</i>, Jululu!

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:24.140
Look out, there's a wolf coming after you!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.100
Huffing and puffing!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.020
And she's... got you!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.390
Mama.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.980
It's about time for your milk, isn't it?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:48.200
That's it, drink it all up so you can become big and strong.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.720
So this is the Divine Hair Accessory?

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.530
It's lovely!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.380
SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé's names are engraved here...

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.290
It's so glittery!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.980
There are so many people today.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.400
They're all here to see the freed Divine Hair Accessory.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:03.140
Not to mention our names engraved near the statue.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.540
Ours is there as well.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.380
That's so cool!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.800
Look, Jululu.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.850
Hey, congratulations, everyone.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.740
What've you got there?

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:25.160
I made some life-size standees for a special victory celebration-kuma.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.000
Wow, thanks so much!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.860
I wonder what it will be...

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.090
I'm pri-ntrigued!

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.800
Good morning, everyone-Da Vinci!

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:37.710
You're all looking in top form this morning-Da Vinci!

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.350
Hm? Why is Ajimi-sensei in homeroom?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.480
Higashiyama-sensei is on maternity leave-Da Vinci!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:47.550
So Ponkan will be taking over as your homeroom teacher-Da Vinci!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.510
What?

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.970
Let's be good friends, boys and gi-Rubens!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.930
What?

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.560
What? Nine points?

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.270
Good day, Miss Manaka.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.230
Ulp. It's the principal.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:06.560
<i>Nine</i> points?

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:13.840
I never imagined it would turn out like this.
I'd always thought you were at the lower end of average.

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.300
Mum! I'm the <i>top</i> of the lower end!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.350
Wait, which is better?

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:31.160
I trusted you to work hard at both study <i>and</i> PriPara.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.330
We'll have to take a break from PriPara, then...

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.680
No... No, PriPara has nothing to do with it.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.200
Well, then how did you score nine points?

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.390
Why... did I score...

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.560
<i>I can't tell her it's because I spend so much time looking after Jululu...</i>

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.220
See, there's no other reason.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.330
Mama!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:04.400
"Ma"...

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:07.600
Wh–Wh–Wh–What's the meaning of this? A daughter?

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.780
Why a daughter? Or is it a son? Oh!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.070
One of my students having a baby? No, it's unthinkable!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.410
I've never heard of such a thing!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.930
Both of you, please calm down!

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:21.630
She's from PriPara?

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:32.610
So I'm taking care of her as her mama now.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.500
So that's how it was.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.990
I had no idea whatsoever.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.620
I've sorry I didn't say anything.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.880
I was running around crazy, taking care of her.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.170
Miss Manaka Lala.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:45.960
Speaking!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:49.840
You've done a fine job looking after a baby these three months.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.630
You should be commended.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.140
Your mother was very impressed, too.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.490
Mum...

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:58.080
However!

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:01.540
From here on, <i>I'll</i> be looking after Jululu.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.420
Y–<i>You</i> will, Principal Ookanda?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.960
You should direct your efforts towards study.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.350
I agree.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.830
No, you can't do that. <i>I'm</i> Jululu's mama!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.640
If I'm not around, she'll...

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:14.450
Oobs!

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.090
Nine points...

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.020
If you don't score 80 points...

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.050
Well... 70 points...

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:25.370
Okay, 60 – if you don't score 60 on your next test...

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.800
Jululu won't be returned to you.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.970
Are we in agreement?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.110
No, hold on!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:33.120
Lala, this is what's best for you and Jululu.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:33.980
Mum...

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:37.800
Don't you worry. Once those grades
go up, she'll come back to you.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.870
So try hard to make that happen.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.800
Take good care of her, Glo-chan.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.940
Good evening, Principal Ookanda...

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:44.890
and her little girl?!

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.850
Oh, congra-tortilla!

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:47.930
Uh... well...

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.840
Then, Miss Manaka. 60 points, you hear me?

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.640
C–Capisce...

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:58.440
I wonder how Jululu's doing...

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.080
I hope she's not crying and missing me.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.290
You have to get her back, Onee-chan.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:07.890
Non?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.740
I think of Jululu as a little sister, you know.

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.600
And it's no fun for my rival to burn herself out like this.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.930
You can score 60 measly points!

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:17.620
Non...

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.370
That's right...

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.590
You're right.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:24.700
60 points is nothing!

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.650
If I don't do this, I won't get Jululu back.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:30.750
I'm Jululu's mama!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.140
Mama...

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.770
Oh, dear, she's crying.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.590
It's okay, Jululu, there's nothing to be scared of.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.130
Please help me study for my next test!

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.620
Of course – you'll be in good hands.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:11:00.740
We're of one mind and body.
We'll work ourselves to the bone, without sleep or rest!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:01.550
Exactly.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.140
Solve these equations in 10 minutes!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.100
Capisce!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.620
Next is social studies.
What is Japan's largest lake?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.000
Swan Lake!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.600
Wrong! It's Lake Biwa!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.480
Capisce...

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.420
Science! What is a baby frog called?

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.380
A froglet!

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.010
Wrong! It's a tadpole!

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.700
Ca–Capisce...

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.820
Repeat after me:

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:26.930
"Very very sexy girl."

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.750
"Verily, verily, she caught cold."

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:30.370
Oh no.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:30.660
speak
louder
than

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.580
Complete the idiom.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:32.590
Easy: "Actions speak louder than romances."

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.920
speak
louder
than

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.880
It's "louder than words"!

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:40.170
And that's a completely different meaning of "action"!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.680
Ca–Capisce...

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.450
Keep your chin up, Lala.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.050
Pushu...

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.410
My head's fried from studying all day...

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.300
In times of trouble, turn to the Devil for guidance.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:53.560
Nope, turn to God.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.850
Some meat buns'll perk you right up!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.650
Thanks, Aroma and Mikan!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.900
How do you find the area of a trapezoid, Onee-chan?

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.580
Top plus bottom times the height divided by two!

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.650
Correct!

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:06.910
All right!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.790
Next is the area of a triangle.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.370
Okay, keep 'em coming!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.270
Dead on my feet...

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.210
<i>I am Dorothy</i> derosaimu...

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.820
Onee-chan, wake up; it's already morning.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:25.390
It's time for the test at last.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.430
Go for it!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.300
You bet!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.770
I'll capisce my best!

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.000
I'm sho shleepy...

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.650
Aw, did widdle Jululu wake up?

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:46.410
I bet you want milk, don't you?

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.610
Mama... Mama...

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:51.470
Mama...

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.060
You don't want milk?
Mama...

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:53.690
You don't want milk?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.030
Um... then... how about this?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.330
Do you like these?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.660
Bouncy-bounce!

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.700
And a bouncy-bouncy-bounce!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.610
Ol' Gloria knows how to calm a babe.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:06.670
And a bouncy-bouncy-bounce!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:08.680
Bounce, bounce!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.170
Hey, I just practiced this!

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.540
Hold on just a bit longer, Jululu.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.570
I'm gonna get those 60 points!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.680
Mama!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.920
Mama! Mama!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.210
That's five minutes to Gogh-Da Vinci!
No time to Dada-wdle!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.280
But don't make Munch ado about nothing; just Gauguin for it!

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.000
<i>I still have so many questions left...</i>

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.660
<i>But I have to do this, for Jululu!</i>

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:56.340
Li'l Julu's gone! Li'l Julu, where did you go?

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:58.560
Li'l Julu!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:02.810
Where, oh where did you go to, Li'l Julu? I have milk for you, sweetie! Come back!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.530
Li'l Julu, Li'l Julu!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:09.990
Meganee, those life-size SoLaMi SMILE standees, for the victory celebration!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.210
I'm taking them to the stage-kuma!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:14.100
Very nice work!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.850
Mama!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.430
Hm?

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:22.140
I thought I heard a voice say "Mama!" just now...

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.600
It must be my imagination.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.600
Mama!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.060
Bear-boop.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:46.240
I sort of went overboard and made nine...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:50.650
I'll keep them up here until the concert's finale.-kuma.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.330
Mama! Mama!

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:03.760
Thanks your your patience-zanne!
Time to hand back the tests.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.520
La, la Laurencin, Miss Manaka Lala!

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:06.680
Yes!

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:09.260
You should be lauded, Clauded, Claude Monet-ed!

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.060
Japanese...

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.780
67 points!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:12.700
All right!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.560
Science: 66 points!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.840
You're darn right!

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:17.660
Social studies: 68 points!

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:18.450
That's it!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.400
And maths...

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.240
58 points.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:21.680
What?

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.170
58 points?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.640
58 points-Da Vinci.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.400
Now I can't see Jululu...

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.220
Manaka-san!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.800
Minami?

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.330
We've got to get to PriPara quickly!

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:42.580
I'm... sorry. I didn't get 60 points in ma–

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.670
Now's not the time to worry about that!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:45.720
Huh?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:46.410
Mama!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.890
Li'l Julu!

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.080
Mama!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.050
Jululu...

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:50.530
Li'l Jululu!

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.040
Mama!

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:53.440
It's dangerous up there, Li'l Julu!

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.090
Jululu...

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.010
It's dangerous up there, Li'l Julu!
Mama! Mama!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:56.980
Oh, just why did she climb up there?

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:58.450
Mama!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.860
Jululu...

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.460
Wait, that's it!

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:04.230
Li'l Julu, come back inside the Rosette Pact!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.230
Mama!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:08.090
Li'l Julu! Get inside the Rosette Pact!

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.600
Mama!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:10.440
Li'l Julu!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.240
Mama...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.050
Li'l Julu!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.720
I brought Lala-pri!

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:17.920
J–Jululu?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:21.250
Oh, Miss Manaka, this is all my fault!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.370
I can't apologise enough!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.180
Ma'am, you look like death itself!

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.690
Li'l Julu!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.690
What's going on?

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:27.630
Oh no, Jululu!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.780
Mama!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.380
Jululu!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.590
Jululu, stay right where you are.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:38.040
Someone told me my standees were too true to life!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.560
Lala, can you get her to go back inside the Rosette Pact?

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.020
Jululu, come back inside the Rosette Pact.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.730
Mama...

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:50.980
Jululu!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.450
Quickly!

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:00.440
Mama! Mama...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.650
Jululu...

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.700
Mama!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.540
Principal Ookanda...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.760
Actually, I didn't get 60 points, just in maths.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.400
But please!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:14.380
Please don't separate me and Jululu!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.720
I don't want Jululu to go away.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:19.720
Miss Lala...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.220
Lala was just two points short, you know.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.370
She can have two of my points.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:26.560
And two of mine as well.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:29.640
Last time, Lala only got <i>nine</i> points,

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:31.530
But this time, it was 58-pri!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.890
Through blood, sweat and tears.

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:36.500
She worked so hard to see Jululu again.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:40.080
Principal Ookanda, I promise I'll do my best every day!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.300
So please, I beg of you!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.280
Very well.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.750
You've earned yourself two bonus points.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.200
Which means...

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.800
You pass!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.630
You can take Jululu home with you.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:57.680
All right! I did it, Jululu!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.780
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.250
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.640
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:25.710
SoLaMi SMILE's team cyalume coord has been reborn as a stage coord!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:28.000
SoLaMi SMILE Lovely Coord!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:36.970
The colours are re-imagined as a lovely light blue, poppy orange and cool purple!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.560
SoLaMi SMILE Pop Coord!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:40.420
Pri!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:47.460
If idol coords took a pop quiz, this baby would get a gold star!

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:49.950
SoLaMi SMILE Cool Coord!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.780
SoLaMi SMILE! My love for you is undying!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.990
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.090
Here...

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:19.940
we go!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.630
Carry it

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:26.650
to everyone!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.340
Receive our feelings!

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:33.790
Exciting present for you!

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:38.240
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.220
Pri!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.840
Lala-san, you're lovely as always!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.700
So you boil pumpkin, and then you can mash it...

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:34.960
That's right.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.890
Jululu's going to eat lots of vegetables soon.

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:41.010
Here we go, Jululu – say "ah".

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.570
Aaaah...

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.740
Hey, Jululu's got a tooth!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:45.330
Huh?

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.700
So she does!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:50.500
She'll be able to eat all sorts of food soon.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.160
Isn't that exciting, Jululu?

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.290
Lala, you keep working hard as Jululu's mama.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.900
And <i>your</i> mama can help you out.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:00.010
Yeah! Thank you very capisce!

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:01.100
Ah-ee!

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:02.600
I'm hominestrone!

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:06.620
Hm? There's a baby in the house.

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:09.140
Yes, there are three Manaka sisters now!

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:11.420
Say <i>what</i>?

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:16.910
She has her first tooth, and she's not playing with my boobies anymore...

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:19.980
Oh, my sweet Li'l Julu...

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:53.020
What?

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:58.180
A new brand will be released to commemorate
the 222nd anniversary of Parajuku's PriPara?

00:23:58.180 --> 00:23:59.860
Aroma, you should totally enter!

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:01.550
They'll definitely pick you-garu!

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:02.580
You think so?

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:07.630
If you so insist, I could be persuaded
to lend you my demonic powers.

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.400
I know you can make the best design ever!

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:12.100
Garuru's cheering for you too!

00:24:12.100 --> 00:24:16.610
Next time, <i>Love! Sepulchroma! Magic Can Achievil Anything</i>!

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:19.810
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
